{"id":"n69512-3-7","stage":2,"title":"자연스럽다 · 自然而然","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69512-3-7-1","ko":"어린아이가 벌써 한글을 읽어요?","zh":"小孩子已经会读韩文了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어린아이가","meaning":"小孩","explanation":"어린아이：小孩；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어린아이","audio":"/audio/883924e23c907a13d4ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70503","senseId":"1","lemma":"어린아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린아이가","audio":"/audio/b1f0a4066d2c4dea013b.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"한글을","meaning":"韩文","explanation":"한글：韩文；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한글","audio":"/audio/bd87f9bb68b67d2fa1cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91525","senseId":"1","lemma":"한글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한글을","audio":"/audio/bec97fdcc7468ac9ec29.mp3"}},{"text":"읽어요?","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽어요","audio":"/audio/0073c5abf9bde13b6a9f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"883924e23c907a13","term":"어린아이","zh":"小孩","audio":"/audio/883924e23c907a13d4ed.mp3","entryId":"70503","definition":"年纪小的孩子。","pronunciation":["어리나이"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"bd87f9bb68b67d2f","term":"한글","zh":"韩文","audio":"/audio/bd87f9bb68b67d2fa1cb.mp3","entryId":"91525","definition":"韩国文字的名称。","pronunciation":["한ː글"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f84